<title>USA: BankAmerica Q4 trading income rises.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica Q4 trading income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said Wednesday that its trading income for the fourth quarter rose to $134 million from $115 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>BankAmerica reported fourth quarter earnings of $747 million, or $1.93 a share, up from $704 million, or $1.74 a share, in the previous fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Noninterest income for the quarter was $1.50 billion, up from $1.16 billion a year earlier. Net interest income slipped to $2.13 billion from $2.15 billion.</p>
</text>
